<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/levin-2014-tumor-09--grok> a <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/LLMClaimAssessment>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Grok 4.7 on levin-2014-tumor-09: needs-new-data, resolvability 0.26";
    dc:description "Outward bioelectric emission is testable once a remote signal and a disconnection control are defined, which the speculation leaves open. No deposited recording set contains that pair for the Xenopus structures or a mammalian counterpart. The detection claim therefore waits on new measurements.";
    dc:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.2.0>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Record bioelectric signals at a distance from induced tumors, with connectivity intact and interrupted, and test whether a remote signature predicts tumor state and disappears when the path is cut. A connectivity-dependent remote signature would support outward emission; no remote signal above controls would refute it.";
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-grok-4.7-high-fast>;
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "No public dataset pairs remote non-neural voltage with these induced structures.", "The emitted signal and the distance at which it should be detectable are unspecified.";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/hasConfidence> "0.55"^^xsd:double;
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/hasScore> "0.259"^^xsd:double;
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/hasVerdict> "needs-new-data".
<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/levin-2014-tumor-09--grok--analysis-feasibility> a <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/LLMClaimAssessment>;
